From: Stained Glass OS <dev@stained-glass.example>
Subject: cryptbase: add the DLL

Windows' base cryptography DLL: its SystemFunction exports, forwarded to
advapi32 (on Windows advapi32 forwards to it). Mozilla's mozglue.dll imports
CRYPTBASE.SystemFunction036 (RtlGenRandom) since Firefox 140; Zotero 10 did
not start (c0000135) without it.

Gate: test/cryptbase-gate.sh.
---
--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -1021,6 +1021,7 @@
 enable_credui
 enable_crtdll
 enable_crypt32
+enable_cryptbase
 enable_cryptdlg
 enable_cryptdll
 enable_cryptext
@@ -22140,6 +22141,7 @@
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/crtdll enable_crtdll
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/crypt32 enable_crypt32
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/crypt32/tests enable_tests
+wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/cryptbase enable_cryptbase
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/cryptdlg enable_cryptdlg
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/cryptdll enable_cryptdll
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/cryptext enable_cryptext
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -2468,6 +2468,7 @@
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/crtdll)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/crypt32)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/crypt32/tests)
+WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/cryptbase)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/cryptdlg)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/cryptdll)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/cryptext)
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/cryptbase/Makefile.in
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+MODULE = cryptbase.dll
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/cryptbase/cryptbase.spec
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Windows' base cryptography DLL: the SystemFunction exports that advapi32
+# also has (on Windows advapi32 forwards them here). Mozilla's mozglue.dll
+# (Firefox-based applications since ESR 140: Zotero 10, Thunderbird)
+# imports RtlGenRandom as CRYPTBASE.SystemFunction036.
+@ stdcall SystemFunction001(ptr ptr ptr) advapi32.SystemFunction001
+@ stdcall SystemFunction002(ptr ptr ptr) advapi32.SystemFunction002
+@ stdcall SystemFunction003(ptr ptr) advapi32.SystemFunction003
+@ stdcall SystemFunction004(ptr ptr ptr) advapi32.SystemFunction004
+@ stdcall SystemFunction005(ptr ptr ptr) advapi32.SystemFunction005
+@ stub SystemFunction028
+@ stub SystemFunction029
+@ stub SystemFunction034
+@ stdcall SystemFunction036(ptr long) advapi32.SystemFunction036
+@ stdcall SystemFunction040(ptr long long) advapi32.SystemFunction040
+@ stdcall SystemFunction041(ptr long long) advapi32.SystemFunction041
